{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301770","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301770","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1230177001:1":{"text":"善人か悪人かって言うと……仕事がなくて飯が食えず、ブラッディ・マリーが気に食わない奴がほとんどだ。俺は、世話をし合ってるあいつらが好きだよ。","source_cn":"好还是不好……很多人都是没活干、没吃的，不服血薇帮才加...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC25F1C3493B910A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230177002:1":{"text":"だが、死海の艦隊は別物だ……俺たちはただ生きることばかり考えてたが、死海の艦隊は俺らが死のうがどうでもいいんだ。","source_cn":"但是，死潮舰队就是另一回事了……我们只想活着，但死潮舰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3C4294A7A3AE8E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230177003:1":{"text":"結局、この埠頭に戻ってきたのは俺一人さ。","source_cn":"最终回到这个码头的，竟然只剩下我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29527F78C82DFC38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230177004:1":{"text":"今になってみれば、キカバみたいにうじうじ悩んでるのも、悪いことじゃなかったのかもな。","source_cn":"现在看起来，像奇卡瓦这样犹豫，或许也并不是坏事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x142D0CD586FD772A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水鬼帮威特":{"text":"ギャングのヴェイト","source":"水鬼帮威特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}